  "body": "* Sun-drenched living \r\n* Seamless indoor-outdoor flow\r\n* Wrap-around deck with pergola\r\n* Flexible family living\r\n* Ground-floor guest bedroom with its own ensuite\r\n* Luxurious master suite with a generous walk-in wardrobe\r\n\r\nA welcoming formal entrance introduces a beautifully presented home designed for relaxed family living and effortless entertaining. At its heart, the open-plan kitchen, dining and family area extends onto an expansive deck, creating an inviting setting for everything from quiet mornings to gatherings with friends.\r\n\r\n* Stone benchtops and sleek kitchen cabinetry\r\n* Butler's pantry complete with cooktop and sink\r\n* Upstairs living area, ideal as a family retreat\r\n* Spacious double bedrooms\r\n* Convenient guest toilet\r\n* Double garaging\r\n\r\nEnjoy the relaxed coastal lifestyle that makes Long Bay so sought after. Long Bay Beach and Regional Park offer beautiful coastal walks, family picnics and days by the sea, while Long Bay Village is within easy walking distance for cafes, dining, shopping and everyday essentials. Zoned for Long Bay Primary School, Northcross Intermediate and Long Bay College, this is an exceptional setting for families to settle in and enjoy.\r\n\r\nConjunctional offers welcomed!\r\nUse this link to view property files: https://www.harcourtsfiles.co.nz/listings/M4FY",
